{"id":"7e655292323dacd0","group":"28","path":"28/28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound.md","title":"形式测度给出公式规模下界","display":"thm-formal-measure-formula-bound — 形式测度给出公式规模下界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound","aliases":["28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound"],"display":"thm-formal-measure-formula-bound — 形式测度给出公式规模下界","depends_on":["[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]","[[28-df-formula-size]]"],"source_book_location":"Theorem 23.5","source_printed_pages":"502","source_pdf_pages":"528","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"local_proof_reviewed":true,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-formal-measure-formula-bound — 形式测度给出公式规模下界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cc32a2c3b871a820\" href=\"?note=cc32a2c3b871a820\" title=\"28-df-formal-complexity-measure\">28-df-formal-complexity-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ebf59bef2c973692\" href=\"?note=ebf59bef2c973692\" title=\"28-df-formula-size\">28-df-formula-size</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Theorem 23.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"502"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"528"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"local_proof_reviewed","html":"true"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note; source-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal B_n=\\{f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(\\mu:\\mathcal B_n\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\">\\(\\operatorname{FormalMeasure}_n(\\mu)\\)</span>，其定义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cc32a2c3b871a820\" href=\"?note=cc32a2c3b871a820\" title=\"28-df-formal-complexity-measure\">28-df-formal-complexity-measure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FS}(f)\">\\(\\operatorname{FS}(f)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ebf59bef2c973692\" href=\"?note=ebf59bef2c973692\" title=\"28-df-formula-size\">28-df-formula-size</a>；FS 计所有语法树节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\quad\\mu(f)\\le\\operatorname{FS}(f).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f:\\{0,1\\}^n\\to\\{0,1\\}\\quad\\mu(f)\\le\\operatorname{FS}(f).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>证明：将任意公式用 De Morgan 律把否定推到文字上，叶子出现次数不增加。对该否定范式树作归纳，文字测度≤1，AND/OR 次可加性使输出测度≤叶数。叶数≤原公式的全部节点数，对最小公式取下界即得。本目录 FS 与原书可能用门数/叶数差一，故这里明确给与本地计数兼容的界。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，Theorem 23.5；印刷页 502；PDF 页 528。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[